#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:10291
msgid "Build forms and manage their entries, notifications, feeds, and daily settings in Minn. Download the plugin .zip from your Gravity account."
msgstr "Maak formulieren en beheer hun invoer, meldingen, feeds en dagelijkse instellingen in Minn. Download de plug-in .zip vanuit uw Gravity-account."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:10303
msgid "Send and track WordPress email through the full Email surface in Minn. Download the plugin .zip from a qualifying Gravity account."
msgstr "Verzend en volg WordPress-e-mail via het volledige e-mailoppervlak in Minnesota. Download de plug-in .zip van een in aanmerking komend Gravity-account."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:10315
msgid "Manage the Perfmatters settings estate from Minn's Performance surface. Download the paid plugin .zip from Perfmatters."
msgstr "Beheer de Perfmatters-instellingen vanuit Minn's Performance-oppervlak. Download de betaalde plug-in .zip van Perfmatters."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:10327
msgid "Bring ACF PRO repeaters, flexible content, galleries, options pages, blocks, and field groups into Minn. Download the plugin .zip from ACF."
msgstr "Breng ACF PRO-repeaters, flexibele inhoud, galerijen, optiepagina's, blokken en veldgroepen naar Minn. Download de plug-in .zip van ACF."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:10339
msgid "Manage Elementor form submissions in Minn while keeping Elementor-owned page content protected. Download the plugin .zip from Elementor."
msgstr "Beheer Elementor-formulierinzendingen in Minn terwijl de pagina-inhoud van Elementor wordt beschermd. Download de plug-in .zip van Elementor."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:10351
